Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAnaBoundedLinearOperator}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,+_Y,\\cdot_X,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land T:X\\to Y\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in K\\;\\left(T(x+_Xx&#39;)=T(x)+_YT(x&#39;)\\land T(\\alpha\\cdot_Xx)=\\alpha\\cdot_YT(x)\\right)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq C\\|x\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAnaBoundedLinearOperator}_S(T,X,Y,K,+_X,+_Y,\\cdot_X,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,K,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land T:X\\to Y\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in K\\;\\left(T(x+_Xx&#39;)=T(x)+_YT(x&#39;)\\land T(\\alpha\\cdot_Xx)=\\alpha\\cdot_YT(x)\\right)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq C\\|x\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-normed-space","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normed-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locat